# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim).
# Played by audio/jingles.js: game/flow.js settleIn, the first time at the first depth of act III in a world.
title    Act III: The sealed memories
composer Claude
about    What she sealed away: a thin glass ring over a singing bowl, then the toy tune only in pieces (A, then Bb, then E, single notes with silence between), a glass harmonica cluster A and Bb, and the bird's call narrowed to a half step, left unresolved.
tempo    80
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.6

# mood explore: lead bird ring haze bowl bass tap

voice lead     crystal    vol=0.72 pan=-0.1
voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.4  rev=0.75
voice ring     glassharp  vol=0.18 pan=0.3  rev=0.8 att=0.1 rel=1
voice haze     glassharp  vol=0.16 pan=-0.2 att=0.8 rel=1.2
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.4  pan=0.1  rev=0.6
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.6
voice tap      glasstap   vol=0.25 pan=0.35

# Am Bb Am: pieces
pattern pieces
ring    | G6----------- | -- .--------- | _ |
bowl    | A2----------- | _ | Bb2----------- |
lead    | .----- A4----- | .--- Bb4- .----- | E5----- .----- |
haze    | _ | A4+Bb4----------- | = |
bass    | A1----------- | Bb1----------- | A1----------- |
bird    | _ | _ | .----- A6 A5+Bb5---- |
tap     | ...... x..... | ..x... ...... | x..... ...... |

loop pieces
